language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

scenario ActivateApt.
condition ActivateAptReady.
condition ActivateAptContinue.
condition ActivateAptReject.
outcome ActivateAptCompleted.
outcome ActivateAptRejected.
step ActivateAptContext.
step ActivateAptActivate.
step ActivateAptPublish.
step ActivateAptFailure.
step ActivateAptSuccess.
condition ActivationDeliveryPending.
outcome ActivationCommittedDeliveryPending.
step ReportActivationDeliveryPending.

ActivateApt illustrates ManageAptDefinitions.
ActivateApt exercises EconomicDecisionContext.
ActivateApt starts-when ActivateAptReady.
ActivateApt starts-at ActivateAptContext.
ActivateAptReady describes "Explicit activation requested for a valid definition under selected policy.".
ActivateAptContinue describes "The previous operation succeeded and the next step's declared contract preconditions remain true; exact predicates are an executable-language gap.".
ActivateAptReject describes "Validation, authority, applicability or operation failure prevents continuation; preserve prior valid state and report the specific reason.".
ActivateAptCompleted describes "The stated design path completed under its explicit obligations; this is not an observed test result.".
ActivateAptRejected describes "The path terminated without claiming the requested change succeeded; failures remain observable.".
ActivateApt preserves DurableFactsRetained.
ActivateApt preserves DomainTruthOwned.
ActivateAptContext calls SelectEconomicPolicy within BuckingService.
ActivateAptContext describes "Do not confuse APT relative machine instruction with settlement economics.".
ActivateAptContext proceeds-to ActivateAptFailure when ActivateAptReject.
ActivateAptContext proceeds-to ActivateAptActivate when ActivateAptContinue.
ActivateAptActivate calls ActivateAptDefinition within BuckingService.
ActivateAptActivate describes "Check lifecycle/generation preconditions; exact activation policy is an open contract.".
ActivateAptActivate proceeds-to ActivateAptFailure when ActivateAptReject.
ActivateAptActivate proceeds-to ActivateAptPublish when ActivateAptContinue.
ActivateAptPublish calls PublishBuckingState within BuckingService.
ActivateAptPublish describes "Durable activation event with source/revision identity.".
ActivateAptPublish proceeds-to ReportActivationDeliveryPending when ActivationDeliveryPending.
ActivateAptPublish proceeds-to ActivateAptSuccess when ActivateAptContinue.
ActivateAptFailure finishes ActivateApt with ActivateAptRejected.
ActivateAptSuccess finishes ActivateApt with ActivateAptCompleted.
ActivationDeliveryPending describes "Activation committed but its publication/delivery is pending; retain the active definition identity and revision while recovering delivery.".
ReportActivationDeliveryPending finishes ActivateApt with ActivationCommittedDeliveryPending.
ActivationCommittedDeliveryPending describes "Activation is authoritative despite incomplete observer delivery; no rollback or repeated activation inferred.".
